admin/posts/drafts.blade.php exists and is routed, but /admin/posts now shows drafts too	Redundant	Either delete drafts.blade.php and its route, or keep as a filtered view
admin/settings/index.blade.php still references settings[container_width] and settings[border_radius] but they don't apply anywhere	Settings saved but no visual effect	Wire them up, or remove from the form
Post::publicShow() scans all posts in PHP (not a where('slug', ...) query)	Slow with many posts	Change to Post::where('slug', $slug)->where('is_published', true)->firstOrFail()
